[node name="Frame" type="Node3D" parent="."]
editor_description = "Greybox only - exact dimensions matter more than looks (ADR 18 / art pipeline). Three decks at y=0/1/2 plus four corner uprights, all use_collision=true on the default layer 1 (world), so cargo rests on the decks and players walk into the frame like any other level geometry."

